#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:4 of
msgid ""
"Note that the criterion is applied to estimating  ``pi_vec``, ``a_mat`` ``mu_vecs`` and ``lambda_mats`` "
"independently. Therefore, a tuple of the dirichlet distribution,  the student's t-distributions and  the "
"wishart distributions will be returned when loss=\"KL\""
msgstr ""
"この基準は、``pi_vec``、``a_mat``、``mu_vecs``、および``lambda_mats``の推定にそれぞれ個別に適用される点にご"
"注意ください。したがって、loss=\"KL\" を指定した場合、ディリクレ分布、スチューデントのt分布、およびウィ"
"シャートの分布のタプルが返されます。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:15
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:12
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:12
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.make_prediction:7
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:12 of
msgid "**loss**"
msgstr "**loss**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:13 of
msgid ""
"Loss function underlying the Bayes risk function, by default \"xxx\". This function supports \"squared\", "
"\"0-1\", and \"KL\"."
msgstr ""
"ベイズリスク関数の基礎となる損失関数で、デフォルトは「xxx」です。この関数では、「squared」、「0-1」、および"
"「KL」がサポートされています。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:20 of
msgid "**Estimates**"
msgstr "**Estimates**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:-1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "a tuple of {numpy ndarray, float, None, or rv_frozen}"
msgstr "tuple of {numpy ndarray, float, None, or rv_frozen}"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:21 of
msgid "``pi_vec_hat`` : the estimate for pi_vec"
msgstr "``pi_vec_hat``：pi_vec の推定値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:22 of
msgid "``a_mat_hat`` : the estimate for a_mat"
msgstr "``a_mat_hat``：a_mat の推定値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:23 of
msgid "``mu_vecs_hat`` : the estimate for mu_vecs"
msgstr "``mu_vecs_hat``：mu_vecs の推定値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:24 of
msgid "``Lambda_mats_hat`` : the estimate for Lambda_mats"
msgstr "``lambda_mats_hat``：lambda_mats の推定値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:25 of
msgid ""
"The estimated values under the given loss function.  If it is not exist, `np.nan` will be returned. If the "
"loss function is \"KL\", the posterior distribution itself  will be returned as rv_frozen object of "
"scipy.stats."
msgstr ""
"指定された損失関数に基づく推定値です。存在しない場合は、`np.nan`が返されます。損失関数が「KL」の場合、事後分"
"布そのものがscipy.statsのrv_frozenオブジェクトとして返されます。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:39 of
msgid ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_continuous`"
msgstr ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_continuous`"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_params:41 of
msgid ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_discrete`"
msgstr ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_discrete`"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.get_p_params:10 of
msgid "**p_params**"
msgstr "**p_params**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.get_p_params:11 of
msgid "``\"p_a_mat\"`` : the value of ``self.p_a_mat``"
msgstr "``\"p_v_mat\"``：``self.p_v_mat``の値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.get_p_params:12 of
msgid "``\"p_mu_vecs\"`` : the value of ``self.p_mu_vecs``"
msgstr "``\"p_mu_vecs\"`` : ``self.p_mu_vecs`` の値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.get_p_params:13 of
msgid "``\"p_nus\"`` : the value of ``self.p_nus``"
msgstr "``\"p_nus\"`` : ``self.p_nus`` の値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.get_p_params:14 of
msgid "``\"p_lambda_mats\"`` : the value of ``self.p_lambda_mats``"
msgstr "``\"p_lambda_mats\"`` : ``self.p_lambda_mats`` の値"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.make_prediction:8
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:13 of
msgid ""
"Loss function underlying the Bayes risk function, by default \"squared\". This function supports "
"\"squared\" and \"0-1\"."
msgstr ""
"ベイズリスク関数の基礎となる損失関数で、デフォルトでは「squared」です。この関数は「squared」と「0-1」をサ"
"ポートしています。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.make_prediction:15 of
msgid "**Predicted_value**"
msgstr "**Predicted_value**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.make_prediction:-1
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:-1 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{float, numpy.ndarray}"
msgstr "{float, numpy.ndarray}"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.make_prediction:16
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:36 of
msgid "The predicted value under the given loss function."
msgstr "与えられた損失関数に基づく予測値です。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:4 of
msgid "h0_params will be overwritten by current hn_params  before updating hn_params by x."
msgstr "h0_params は、x によって hn_params を更新する前に、現在の hn_params で上書きされます"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:10
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:10 of
msgid "It must be a `c_degree`-dimensional vector"
msgstr "それはc次元のベクトルでなければなりません"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:27
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:23 of
msgid "convergence croterion of variational lower bound, by default 1.0E-8"
msgstr "変分下限の収束基準。デフォルトは 1.0E-8 です"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:30
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:26 of
msgid "``'random_responsibility'``: randomly assign responsibility to ``xi_mats`` and ``gamma_vecs``"
msgstr "``'random_responsibility'``: ``xi_mats`` と ``gamma_vecs`` に負担率をランダムに割り当てます"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:27 of
msgid ""
"``'subsampling'``: for each latent class, extract a subsample whose size is ``int(np.sqrt(x.shape[0]))``.  "
"and use its mean and covariance matrix as an initial values of hn_m_vecs and hn_lambda_mats."
msgstr ""
"``'サブサンプリング'``：各潜在クラスについて、サイズが ``int(np.sqrt(x.shape[0]))`` となる部分サンプルを抽出"
"します。そして、その平均と共分散行列を ``hn_m_vecs`` および ``hn_lambda_mats`` の初期値として使用します。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:29 of
msgid "Type of initialization, by default 'random_responsibility'"
msgstr "初期化の種類。デフォルトは ``'random_responsibility'`` です"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.pred_and_update:35 of
msgid "**predicted_value**"
msgstr "**predicted_value**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:4 of
msgid ""
"If the ``viterbi`` option is ``True``, this function estimates  the latent variables maximizing the joint "
"distribution.  If ``False``, this function independently estimates the latent  variables at each time point."
msgstr ""
"「viterbi」オプションが「True」の場合、この関数は、同時分布を最大化する潜在変数を推定します。「False」の場"
"合、この関数は各時点において潜在変数を個別に推定します。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:16
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:13 of
msgid ""
"Loss function underlying the Bayes risk function, by default \"0-1\". If the ``viterbi`` option is "
"``True``, this function supports only \"0-1\".  Otherwise, \"0-1\", \"squared\", and \"KL\" are supported."
msgstr ""
"ベイズリスク関数の基礎となる損失関数で、デフォルトは「0-1」です。``viterbi`` オプションが ``True`` の場合、"
"この関数は「0-1」のみをサポートします。それ以外の場合は、「0-1」、「squared」、および「KL」がサポートされま"
"す。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:20
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:17 of
msgid "**viterbi**"
msgstr "**viterbi**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:-1
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:-1 of
msgid "bool, optional"
msgstr "bool, optional"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:21
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:18 of
msgid "If ``True``, this function estimates the latent variables as a sequence."
msgstr "「True」の場合、この関数は潜在変数をシーケンスとして推定します。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:27
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:39 of
msgid "**estimates**"
msgstr "**estimates**"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars:28
#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:40 of
msgid ""
"The estimated values under the given loss function.  If the ``viterbi`` option is ``False`` and loss "
"function is \"KL\",  a marginalized posterior distribution will be returned as  a numpy.ndarray whose "
"elements consist of occurence  probabilities for each latent variabl."
msgstr ""
"指定された損失関数に基づく推定値です。``viterbi`` オプションが ``False`` で、損失関数が \"KL\" の場合、各潜"
"在変数の出現確率からなる要素を持つ numpy.ndarray として、周辺化された事後分布が返されます。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:4 of
msgid "h0_params will be overwritten by current hn_params  before updating hn_params by x"
msgstr "h0_params は、x によって hn_params を更新する前に、現在の hn_params で上書きされます"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:31 of
msgid ""
"``'subsampling'``: for each latent class, extract a subsample whose size is ``int(np.sqrt(x.shape[0]))``. "
"and use its mean and covariance matrix as an initial values of hn_m_vecs and hn_lambda_mats."
msgstr ""
"``'サブサンプリング'``：各潜在クラスについて、サイズが ``int(np.sqrt(x.shape[0]))`` となる部分サンプルを抽出"
"します。そして、その平均と共分散行列を ``hn_m_vecs`` および ``hn_lambda_mats`` の初期値として使用します。"

#: bayesml.hiddenmarkovnormal._hiddenmarkovnormal.LearnModel.estimate_latent_vars_and_update:33 of
msgid "Type of initialization, by default ``'random_responsibility'``"
msgstr "初期化の種類。デフォルトは ``'random_responsibility'`` です"
